#: ui/admin/settings-reset.php:288
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to Reset your Weekend?\n"
"\n"
"There is no going back, you cannot reclaim anything you've gained throughout your weekend.\n"
"\n"
"You are about to be groundhoggin' it"
msgstr ""
"¿Seguro que quieres reiniciar tu fin de semana?\n"
"\n"
"No hay vuelta atrás, no puedes reclamar nada de lo que hayas ganado durante tu fin de semana.\n"
"\n"
"Estás a punto de ser hecho cisco"

#: ui/admin/settings-reset.php:285
msgid "By resetting the weekend, you will be sent back to Friday night and the weekend you've just spent will be erased. You will retain all of your memories of the weekend, and be able to relive it in any way you wish."
msgstr "Al reiniciar el fin de semana, se te enviará de vuelta a la noche del viernes y el fin de semana que acaba de pasar se borrará. Conservarás todos tus recuerdos del fin de semana y podrás revivirlo de la manera que quieras."

#: ui/admin/settings-reset.php:284
msgid "This feature has been exclusively built for Pods to help developers suffering from \"Monday\", and allows them to reset the weekend."
msgstr "Esta característica ha sido construida exclusivamente para Pods para ayudar a los desarrolladores que sufren de \"lunes\" y les permite reiniciar el fin de semana."

#: ui/admin/settings-reset.php:282
msgid "Reset Weekend"
msgstr "Reiniciar el fin de semana"

